  "extractionNotes": "Self-employed father: preferential title 0570 from 2023-03-01, then Mały ZUS Plus 0590 from 2025-03-01 with voluntary sickness insurance (CWR), the business title ending 2026-03-18, the last day of the leave. The sickness start before 2025-03-01 is not legible, so the voluntary period starts at 2025-03-01. The ZAM asked for 8 weeks + 3 days (about 15/16.01..14.03.2026); the claimant corrected it in writing to end on 18.03.2026 and declared no other title, giving exactly 63 days from 2026-01-15. The correction was filed via PUE (received 2026-01-20); decision granting the benefit issued 2026-01-28 (outgoing-documents list), decision text not in the file, so the period is the corrected claim. The mother had used maternity benefit before (box ticked, dates illegible). Father's 9 weeks are always 70%; rate not printed. Mały ZUS Plus base: possible top-up, not stated."
